  - Entity: 1222000001000002
    TagComponent:
      Tag: Soft Key
    TransformComponent:
      Translation: [-34.468, 1.72, 195.924]
      Rotation: [0, 0, 0]
      Scale: [1, 1, 1]
    PointLightComponent:
      Color: [1, 0.97, 0.93]
      Intensity: 6
      Range: 3
      CastShadows: true
      RayTracedShadows: true
  # -- HARD SIDE (dimmed). Almost in the head's own plane, which is where the
  #    layered specular of #1243 and the pore band are legible. Raise to ~9 and
  #    drop the soft key to ~0.5 for the hard-side cell. --
  - Entity: 1222000001000003
    TagComponent:
      Tag: Hard Side
    TransformComponent:
      Translation: [-33.772, 1.46, 195.596]
      Rotation: [0, 0, 0]
      Scale: [1, 1, 1]
    PointLightComponent:
      Color: [1, 0.96, 0.90]
      Intensity: 0.6
      Range: 3
      CastShadows: true
      RayTracedShadows: true
  # -- BACKLIGHT (dimmed). From behind the head toward the lens, slightly down
  #    and from the ear's side, so it reaches the BACK of the pinna past the
  #    skull. Raise to ~6 and drop the other two to ~0.3 for the backlight cell:
  #    this is the only rig under which #1242's transmission through the ears
  #    is what the picture is made of.
  #
  #    DIRECTIONAL, AND UNSHADOWED, and both are load-bearing (#1394):
  #    * Forward+ evaluates skin transmission for the directional light only —
  #      its clustered punctual lights do not transmit — so a point backlight
  #      left that path's backlight cell showing nothing.
  #    * Shadowed, the ear goes BLACK in the editor: at the editor camera's
  #      cascade resolution a ~3 mm ear is thicker than the shadow normal
  #      offset and occludes itself — the limit docs/guides/skin-transmission.md
  #      states. What a shadow would otherwise have done here (keep skin the
  #      light can only reach THROUGH the head dark, the closed eyelids first
  #      among it) the baked map does instead: its far-side test reads any thin
  #      region whose back opens into an enclosed pocket as thick. --
  - Entity: 974000002000012
    TagComponent:
      Tag: Moving Lantern
    TransformComponent:
      Translation: [247, 9.26644, 229]
      Rotation: [0, 0, 0]
      Scale: [1, 1, 1]
    PointLightComponent:
      Color: [1, 0.75, 0.45]
      Intensity: 12
      Range: 14
      Attenuation: 1
      CastShadows: true
      RayTracedShadows: true
      ShadowBias: 0.005
      ShadowNormalBias: 0.01
